# Terraform state — remote state (S3) is the source of truth
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfstate*
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Variable files with real values — never commit secrets
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# Saved plan files
**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan

# SSH keys
*.pem
*.key
*_rsa
*_ed25519
devkey
testkey

# Project documentation — internal use only, not for version control
project_objectives.md
project_scope.md
techstack.md
step-by-step.md
